[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4980.99, "timestamp": "01:23:00", "text": "クソッ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4984.31, "timestamp": "01:23:04", "text": "高い。私は何のためにタクシーに乗ったの？ただ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4986.717, "timestamp": "01:23:06", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ5L1KpS3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ5L1KpS3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4986.79, "timestamp": "01:23:06", "text": "5分もかからなかった。それは私に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4989.99, "timestamp": "01:23:09", "text": "2,500円。だから、絶対にタクシーに乗ってはいけない。いつも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4992.39, "timestamp": "01:23:12", "text": "地下鉄に乗る。うん。そうすれば、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4993.42, "timestamp": "01:23:13", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I think joqqy u should probably write this stuff down"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4993.99, "timestamp": "01:23:13", "text": "地下鉄で、なぜなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4997.35, "timestamp": "01:23:17", "text": "問題は、地下鉄で行けることだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4999.43, "timestamp": "01:23:19", "text": "隅から隅まで。あなた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5003.27, "timestamp": "01:23:23", "text": "心配する必要はありません。 Mだからあなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5005.11, "timestamp": "01:23:25", "text": "心配しなくていいよ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5006.79, "timestamp": "01:23:26", "text": "そして、あなたは慣れるでしょう、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5008.95, "timestamp": "01:23:28", "text": "歩くことに慣れている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5011.03, "timestamp": "01:23:31", "text": "私は歩くことに慣れています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5014.47, "timestamp": "01:23:34", "text": "過去にはあなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5016.629, "timestamp": "01:23:36", "text": "大丈夫、あなたは大丈夫でしょう、なぜなら私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5019.83, "timestamp": "01:23:39", "text": "全く歩かない友達は、私にとって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5022.47, "timestamp": "01:23:42", "text": "私はナガランドのアルナチに住んでいます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5024.31, "timestamp": "01:23:44", "text": "たくさん歩くので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5026.149, "timestamp": "01:23:46", "text": "歩く、たぶんあなたはどんな風に歩かなければならないのか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5028.79, "timestamp": "01:23:48", "text": "15分から30分くらいかかることもある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5030.95, "timestamp": "01:23:50", "text": "ある駅から別の駅へ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5032.47, "timestamp": "01:23:52", "text": "しかし、それは平凡なので、感じないでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5033.91, "timestamp": "01:23:53", "text": "何でも。そして、もしあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5035.27, "timestamp": "01:23:55", "text": "歩くのが一番いいでしょう。あなた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5036.79, "timestamp": "01:23:56", "text": "何も心配する必要はありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5038.87, "timestamp": "01:23:58", "text": "でも、自転車を手に入れることもお勧めします。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5039.861, "timestamp": "01:23:59", "author": "@gaurdiangaming4603", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mFiZLBZWkzinaMdP6tEYkP1j69A0G3jL01PKtnzXI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "her \"fast as f@wk\" would work as a good advertisement for a phone company"}]